<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <!-- The "dotnet new" template pack: dotnet new install NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.Templates
       Then:  dotnet new holonet-api | holonet-client   (see templates/README.md for the full list).
       Part of the lockstep HoloNET release (packages.json). Content folders are templates, not code, so nothing here compiles. -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageType>Template</PackageType>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <PackageId>NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.Templates</PackageId>
    <Title>HoloNET project templates</Title>
    <Version>4.6.2</Version>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>## v4.6.2 - Part of the HoloNET 4.6.2 release (every HoloNET package is versioned together): https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp/releases/tag/v4.6.2

45 templates: every common .NET app, library and test project type (web, SignalR, MCP server, Native AOT, Orleans, Terminal.Gui, Aspire, Avalonia MVVM and cross-platform, Wear OS, Mac Catalyst, OpenSilver, Godot, WPF/WinForms/Razor/MAUI/Android/iOS libraries, MSTest, NUnit). Installed templates now keep their .gitignore.

HoloNET 4.6.1

- Reuse the persisted app-bound WebSocket listener when reconnecting. If none exists, create a listener bound to that app on loopback.
- Fix the Holochain 0.7.1 coordinator-update request encoding.
- Add bounded diagnostics for managed Linux conductor startup.

Release: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp/releases/tag/v4.6.1</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Authors>NextGen Software Ltd</Authors>
    <Description>dotnet new templates for HoloNET: a one-line HoloNET API app, a full HoloNET Client app and more, each with the bundled Holochain conductor (0.7.0 and 0.7.1) or your own.</Description>
    <PackageTags>holochain;holonet;dotnet-new;templates</PackageTags>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <IncludeContentInPack>true</IncludeContentInPack>
    <IncludeBuildOutput>false</IncludeBuildOutput>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);NU5128;NU5111</NoWarn>
    <EnableDefaultItems>false</EnableDefaultItems>
    <!-- Template content includes dot-files (.gitignore, .mcp/server.json): pack them too. -->
    <NoDefaultExcludes>true</NoDefaultExcludes>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="content\**\*" Exclude="content\**\bin\**;content\**\obj\**;content\**\.sandbox\**" />
    <Compile Remove="**\*" />
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
